WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.023
Zann couldn't see what was scaring his parents.

2
00:00:03.024 --> 00:00:08.481
All he could see was their terrified faces and the powerful magic swirling around them.

3
00:00:08.482 --> 00:00:14.735
"No!" Zann cried as his mother screamed and his father let out a yell of fear.

4
00:00:14.736 --> 00:00:20.306
Then he felt a sharp pain on one side of his head, and the vision faded away.

5
00:00:20.307 --> 00:00:27.775
He was still in the vortex. Wyssa had let go of his arm, but now she was pinching his ear—hard.

6
00:00:27.776 --> 00:00:31.690
"Ow!" Zann exclaimed. "Stop that!"

7
00:00:31.691 --> 00:00:37.251
"I'll let go of your ear when you let go of that wormhole," Wyssa said.

8
00:00:37.252 --> 00:00:40.953
Zann realized he was clinging to the edge of a wormhole.

9
00:00:40.954 --> 00:00:44.115
He had grabbed it without even knowing he was doing so.

10
00:00:44.116 --> 00:00:48.082
Was that because of the dream? Could this wormhole be a clue?

11
00:00:48.083 --> 00:00:51.828
"Wait," he said, peering into the wormhole.

12
00:00:51.829 --> 00:00:58.610
He caught a glimpse of purple-leaved trees waving in a soft breeze. "I want to see if—"

13
00:00:58.611 --> 00:01:02.986
Wyssa gave one last yank on Zann's ear, and he lost his grip.

14
00:01:02.987 --> 00:01:06.833
A second later the wormhole was out of sight behind him.

15
00:01:06.834 --> 00:01:09.610
"What was that all about?" Perda asked.

16
00:01:09.611 --> 00:01:15.414
Zann couldn't respond. He was too breathless and confused by what had just happened.

17
00:01:15.415 --> 00:01:21.110
"Hold on tight," Wyssa said. "A useful world is coming up shortly.

18
00:01:21.111 --> 00:01:26.607
You two can rest there and regain your energy while I put my potion together."

19
00:01:26.608 --> 00:01:29.033
She pulled them through a new wormhole.

20
00:01:29.034 --> 00:01:32.986
They landed in a beautiful little park in the middle of a town.

21
00:01:32.987 --> 00:01:39.715
However, Zann barely had a second to take in the scenery before he gasped and grabbed his nose.

22
00:01:39.716 --> 00:01:47.870
"Ew!" Perda cried beside him. She was pinching her nose shut. "What is that stink

23
00:01:47.871 --> 00:01:56.226
?" "Where are we?" Zann's voice sounded funny now that he was holding his nose. "Why does it smell so

24
00:01:56.227 --> 00:02:02.330
bad?" Wyssa sniffed the air. "We're in Niffia. It may not smell nice to

25
00:02:02.331 --> 00:02:07.346
us. But it's a peaceful place with friendly, intelligent, and welcoming

26
00:02:07.347 --> 00:02:13.956
people. You'll be safe here while I work. Oh, and your magic should function normally in this

27
00:02:13.957 --> 00:02:20.256
world. So you two might want to create some food to fortify yourselves for the rest of our

28
00:02:20.257 --> 00:02:23.535
journey." Zann couldn't imagine wanting to eat anything in this

29
00:02:23.536 --> 00:02:28.212
place. Before he or Perda could say anything else, though, Wyssa zapped out of

30
00:02:28.213 --> 00:02:33.479
sight. "Ugh," Perda said. "I can't believe this

31
00:02:33.480 --> 00:02:36.960
stench!" "Yeah. I can't stand it any

32
00:02:36.961 --> 00:02:42.358
longer." Zann let go of his nose and rubbed his hands together. "Protect!" he

33
00:02:42.359 --> 00:02:47.371
said. He frowned as a puff of smoke wafted up from his hands. Nothing else

34
00:02:47.372 --> 00:02:50.437
happened. "What are you trying to do?" Perda

35
00:02:50.438 --> 00:02:56.294
asked. "Create a Shield spell around my head." Zann grabbed his nose

36
00:02:56.295 --> 00:02:59.971
again. "I thought Wyssa said our magic would work

37
00:02:59.972 --> 00:03:03.520
here." Perda shrugged. "Magic requires focusing our

38
00:03:03.521 --> 00:03:07.709
minds. It's pretty hard to focus on anything except this awful

39
00:03:07.710 --> 00:03:11.416
smell." Zann saw several figures hurrying toward them across the park.

40
00:03:11.417 --> 00:03:17.686
They looked like regular humans except for one thing: they had no noses!

41
00:03:17.687 --> 00:03:22.500
"Welcome!" a man said. "Are you visitors to Niffia?"

42
00:03:22.501 --> 00:03:28.515
"Yes," Zann said. "We, um, won't be here long. Sorry to bother you."

43
00:03:28.516 --> 00:03:31.517
"No bother at all!" The Niffian beamed.

44
00:03:31.518 --> 00:03:36.883
"We love visitors, and yet we have so few. May we show you around town?"

45
00:03:36.884 --> 00:03:41.383
For the next half hour, the Niffians gave Zann and Perda a tour.

46
00:03:41.384 --> 00:03:44.899
The rest of the town was just as charming as the park.

47
00:03:44.900 --> 00:03:49.781
Everywhere Zann and Perda went, friendly Niffians stopped to say hello.

48
00:03:49.782 --> 00:03:52.461
Even the songs of the birds were beautiful.

49
00:03:52.462 --> 00:03:58.178
"Too bad we don't know any spells to shut off our sense of smell," Perda whispered to Zann.

50
00:03:58.179 --> 00:04:03.431
"Yeah," Zann muttered back. He wasn't paying much attention to the tour.

51
00:04:03.432 --> 00:04:07.004
He wished Wyssa would hurry, and not only because of the smell.

52
00:04:07.005 --> 00:04:10.074
He was worried about Gliss, Darb, and Zing.

53
00:04:10.075 --> 00:04:12.608
Finally Wyssa zapped into sight.

54
00:04:12.609 --> 00:04:16.927
"Wyssa?" One of the Niffians greeted her with a smile.

55
00:04:16.928 --> 00:04:21.835
"It's been far too long since we've enjoyed a visit from you!"

56
00:04:21.836 --> 00:04:26.565
Wyssa bowed. "Thank you for your hospitality, my friend.

57
00:04:26.566 --> 00:04:31.399
I'm grateful that you're always so generous with your natural resources.

58
00:04:31.400 --> 00:04:36.790
Once again I've found exactly what I need for one of my potions."

59
00:04:36.791 --> 00:04:41.984
Wyssa held up her hands, which were now covered with strange purple symbols.

60
00:04:41.985 --> 00:04:45.532
"Ah," another Niffian said with a smile.

61
00:04:45.533 --> 00:04:50.995
"Yes, our native oogberry is useful for many spells, isn't it?"

62
00:04:50.996 --> 00:04:56.397
"Indeed," Wyssa said. "Now I'm afraid my young friends and I must be going.

63
00:04:56.398 --> 00:04:59.355
We have urgent business in the vortex."

64
00:04:59.356 --> 00:05:05.589
"Travel safely," a Niffian said. "I hope we'll see you all again soon."

65
00:05:05.590 --> 00:05:09.675
"Thanks," Zann said. He had enjoyed meeting the Niffians.

66
00:05:09.676 --> 00:05:15.869
But secretly he hoped he'd never have to smell anything like Niffia ever again!

67
00:05:15.870 --> 00:05:20.476
Soon Wyssa, Zann, and Perda were passing through the wormhole.

68
00:05:20.477 --> 00:05:26.909
"Whew!" Perda exclaimed. "I've never been so glad to be back in the vortex!"

69
00:05:26.910 --> 00:05:30.141
"What happens now?" Zann asked Wyssa.

70
00:05:30.142 --> 00:05:37.854
Wyssa stared at her hands. "These markings will let us know which wormholes have been used recently."

71
00:05:37.855 --> 00:05:44.554
The group drifted through the vortex. After a few minutes, the purple symbols began to glow.

72
00:05:44.555 --> 00:05:47.430
"There's a wormhole just ahead," said Wyssa.

73
00:05:47.431 --> 00:05:53.874
"Someone has passed through it recently." She reached out as an opening spun into view.

74
00:05:53.875 --> 00:05:57.726
A moment later Zann felt himself leave the vortex.

75
00:05:57.727 --> 00:06:02.409
"Oof!" he grunted as he landed on cold, hard ground.

76
00:06:02.410 --> 00:06:07.811
This new world was so dark, Zann could barely see his hand in front of his face.

77
00:06:07.812 --> 00:06:10.874
A strange buzzing sound filled the air.

78
00:06:10.875 --> 00:06:13.786
It seemed to be coming from all around them.

79
00:06:13.787 --> 00:06:20.217
Feeling nervous, Zann snapped his fingers. "Light," he whispered, holding out his hand.

80
00:06:20.218 --> 00:06:23.530
A glowing orb of light appeared in his hand.

81
00:06:23.531 --> 00:06:29.888
A second later it exploded into a huge fireball!

